  "content": "<p>The textbook presents an example-driven approach to power systems, moving from foundational concepts to system-level analysis. It emphasizes equivalent models, and computational techniques for engineering design.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>Key Topics</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Network theory</li>\n<li>AC power flow</li>\n<li>Polyphase systems</li>\n<li>Symmetrical components</li>\n<li>Electric machines</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Author:</strong> James L. Kirtley Jr.</p>\n",
